  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for mobilizing new high net worth individual philanthropy for global SRHR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Rockefeller Philanthropy Advisors will support a new initiative that aims to increase funding for global sexual and reproductive health causes from high-net wealth individuals. Together with the Children&#x2019;s Investment Fund, Gates, and Packard foundations, this initiative will build new donor interest and provide an advisory and &#x201C;matchmaking&#x201D; service for investments in the SRHR field, with a focus on long-term investments, local NGOs, and rights-based approaches. This grant is aligned with the Global Reproductive Equity strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
